  /* zh 红涨绿跌 (operator ruling 2026-07-21): ok/bad chips are direction reads →
     swap tint pairs in zh (mirrors the china.html.j2 #3174 okchip/badchip pattern) */
  html[data-lang="zh"] body.page-canada .cax-okchip{background:rgba(224,100,100,.13);color:#eda8a8}
