    </div>
    <div class="cax-dlg-body">
      {% if _cs %}
      {% set _lit = _cs.pct_above_50 | round | int %}
      {% set _mom = [[50 + 2 * _cs.chg20, 0] | max, 100] | min %}
      {# hero — score + zone label + where 62 sits on the thin/mixed/broad rail #}
      <div class="mp-hero">
        <div class="mp-score-col">
          <div class="mp-score">{{ _cs.score }}<span class="of">/100</span></div>
          <div class="mp-zone"><span class="l-en">{{ _cs.label_en }}</span><span class="l-zh">{{ _cs.label_zh }}</span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="mp-hero-right">
          <p class="mp-thesis">{{ t(
            'How much of the TSX is actually moving together — a breadth read, not a fear/greed index. A glance tells you whether strength is broad or just a few names.',
            '衡量有多少 TSX 成分股在同向运行 — 这是市场宽度读数，并非恐慌／贪婪指数。一眼看出走强是广泛的还是仅由少数股票带动。') }}</p>
          <div class="mp-rail">
            <div class="seg s-thin" style="width:40%"></div>
            <div class="seg s-mixed" style="width:20%"></div>
            <div class="seg s-broad" style="width:40%"></div>
            <div class="mp-rail-marker" style="left:{{ [[_cs.score, 1] | max, 99] | min }}%"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="mp-rail-scale"><span style="left:40%">40</span><span style="left:60%">60</span></div>
          <div class="mp-rail-ends"><span>{{ t('Thin','稀薄') }}</span><span>{{ t('Mixed','中性') }}</span><span>{{ t('Broad','广泛') }}</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      {# stance — Law 1 plain-word "so what do I do" #}
      <div class="mp-stance">
        <svg class="st-ico" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2 3 7v6c0 5 3.8 8.3 9 9 5.2-.7 9-4 9-9V7z"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
        <div class="st-tx">{% if _cs.zone == 'broad' %}<span class="l-en"><b>The move has support under it.</b> Trend-following is on firmer ground — still size to the regime gauge above.</span><span class="l-zh"><b>上涨有基础支撑。</b>顺势交易的立足点更稳 — 仍需按上方周期表盘控制仓位。</span>{% elif _cs.zone == 'thin' %}<span class="l-en"><b>Watch — don’t chase.</b> A few names are carrying the tape. Wait for breadth to confirm before trusting a breakout.</span><span class="l-zh"><b>观望，勿追高。</b>少数股票在拉动指数。等待宽度确认后再相信突破。</span>{% else %}<span class="l-en"><b>No edge from breadth here.</b> Neither broad nor thin — let the regime gauge lead and keep size modest.</span><span class="l-zh"><b>此处宽度无优势。</b>不广也不薄 — 由周期表盘主导，仓位保持温和。</span>{% endif %}</div>
      </div>
      {# two illustrations — the population taking part, and what builds the score #}
      <div class="mp-grid">
        <div>
          <div class="cax-lbl">{{ t('Names taking part','参与的成分股') }}</div>
          <div class="mp-field">{% for _i in range(100) %}<i{% if _i < _lit %} class="on"{% endif %}></i>{% endfor %}</div>
          <div class="mp-field-cap"><span class="l-en">About <b>{{ _lit }}</b> of every 100 TSX names are above their 50-day line.</span><span class="l-zh">每 100 只 TSX 成分股中约 <b>{{ _lit }}</b> 只站上其 50 日均线。</span></div>
          <div class="mp-field-sub">{% if _cs.zone == 'broad' %}{{ t('Broad — most of the market is participating.','广泛 — 多数股票在参与。') }}{% elif _cs.zone == 'thin' %}{{ t('Thin — a few names carrying the tape.','稀薄 — 少数股票在拉动指数。') }}{% else %}{{ t('Mixed — about half the market is participating.','中性 — 约半数股票在参与。') }}{% endif %}</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="cax-lbl">{{ t('What builds the score','评分构成') }}</div>
          <div class="mp-bars">
            <div class="mp-bar-row"><div class="br-top"><span class="br-name"><span class="l-en">Names above 50-day line</span><span class="l-zh">站上50日线</span><span class="br-wt">45%</span></span><span class="br-val">{{ _cs.pct_above_50 }}%</span></div><div class="mp-bar-track"><div class="mp-bar-fill" style="width:{{ [[_cs.pct_above_50, 0] | max, 100] | min }}%"></div></div></div>
            <div class="mp-bar-row"><div class="br-top"><span class="br-name"><span class="l-en">Names above 200-day line</span><span class="l-zh">站上200日线</span><span class="br-wt">30%</span></span><span class="br-val">{{ _cs.pct_above_200 }}%</span></div><div class="mp-bar-track"><div class="mp-bar-fill" style="width:{{ [[_cs.pct_above_200, 0] | max, 100] | min }}%"></div></div></div>
            <div class="mp-bar-row"><div class="br-top"><span class="br-name"><span class="l-en">Advancers today</span><span class="l-zh">当日上涨占比</span><span class="br-wt">15%</span></span><span class="br-val">{{ _cs.ad_ratio }}%</span></div><div class="mp-bar-track"><div class="mp-bar-fill" style="width:{{ [[_cs.ad_ratio, 0] | max, 100] | min }}%"></div></div></div>
            <div class="mp-bar-row"><div class="br-top"><span class="br-name"><span class="l-en">Trend (20-day change)</span><span class="l-zh">趋势（20日变化）</span><span class="br-wt">10%</span></span><span class="br-val">{{ '%+.1f'|format(_cs.chg20) }} {{ t('pts','点') }}</span></div><div class="mp-bar-track"><div class="mp-bar-fill" style="width:{{ _mom | round(1) }}%"></div></div></div>
          </div>
          <div class="mp-note">{{ t('Each input is scaled 0–100 and weighted into one read. Higher-weight rows move the number most.','每项输入归一化为 0–100 后按权重合成为单一读数。权重越高的项对数字影响越大。') }}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="cax-foot">{{ t('Display-only composite of S&P/TSX Composite breadth (~220 names). Bands: broad ≥60 · mixed 40–59 · thin <40. Not scored, not a trading signal.',
        '标普/TSX 综合指数市场宽度（约220只）的仅展示合成指标。区间：广泛 ≥60 · 中性 40–59 · 稀薄 <40。不计分，非交易信号。') }}{% if _cs.asof %} · {{ t('as of','截至') }} {{ _cs.asof }}{% endif %}</div>
      {% else %}
      <p class="cax-thesis" style="max-width:52ch">{{ t(
        'Watch — not enough data yet. The market-participation read is built from S&P/TSX Composite breadth (how many names are above their moving averages), which isn’t available right now. It fills in on the nightly run.',
        '观望 — 数据尚不足。市场参与度读数由标普/TSX 综合指数的市场宽度（多少成分股站上均线）计算，目前暂缺，将在每晚运行时补齐。') }}</p>
      <div class="cax-foot">{{ t('Display-only breadth composite — never a trading signal.','仅展示的市场宽度合成指标 — 绝非交易信号。') }}</div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

